OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies after crashing
OL,4,Ainto fence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 38-year-old man has died after his
OL,7,Fmotorbike left the road and crashed
OL,8,Finto a fence in East Yorkshire.
OL,10,FHumberside Police said the Suzuki
OL,11,Fmotorcycle was on Fieldend Lane in
OL,12,FElstronwick, heading towards Burton
OL,13,FPidsea, when it hit the fence shortly
OL,14,Fafter 15:00 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FHe was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FOfficers are appealing for witnesses or
OL,19,Fanyone with relevant dashcam footage to
OL,20,Fget in touch.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
